<Policy title="Terms of sale" description="The terms that apply when you use foxfobz.com and buy a Fox Fobz kit.">
  <p>
    These terms apply when you use foxfobz.com or buy from {site.legalName} (“Fox Fobz”, “we”). By placing an order you
    agree to them.
  </p>

  <h2>Orders and pricing</h2>
  <p>
    Prices are in US dollars. Shipping and sales tax are calculated at checkout. Your order is accepted when payment
    succeeds and you receive a receipt. We may cancel and fully refund an order if a product is unavailable, if there’s
    an obvious pricing error, or if we suspect fraud.
  </p>

  <h2>Fitment and installation</h2>
  <p>
    Fox Fobz kits are designed for 1985–1993 Ford Mustang Coupe, Hatchback and Convertible models with factory power
    door locks. Please choose the correct year and body style when ordering. Installation involves working on your
    vehicle’s electrical system. If you aren’t comfortable doing that, have a qualified installer do it. Follow the
    install instructions and video, and disconnect the battery before you start.
  </p>

  <h2>The app</h2>
  <p>
    Lock health and current-draw information in the Fox Fobz app is an estimate to help you spot wear. It isn’t a
    guarantee that a lock or actuator will or won’t fail. Don’t rely on the kit or app as your only means of securing your
    vehicle.
  </p>

  <h2>Shipping, warranty and returns</h2>
  <p>
    See our <a href="/shipping">Shipping</a> and <a href="/warranty-returns">Warranty &amp; returns</a> pages, which are
    part of these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, our total liability for any claim related to a product is limited to the amount you
    paid for it, and we aren’t liable for indirect, incidental or consequential damages. Some states don’t allow these
    limits, so they may not apply to you. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer protection laws
    that can’t be waived.
  </p>

  <h2>Trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Fox Fobz is an independent company and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ford Motor Company. Ford and Mustang are
    trademarks of Ford Motor Company, used here only to describe the vehicles our products fit.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of {site.governingState}.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
</Policy>
